{"id": "DerToUSCdSY", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Remember when YouTube views used to get stuck at 301? The video was going viral, but the counter just… froze. 👀\n\nWhy: not every view is real. Bots and people refreshing again and again. So after 300, YouTube paused to check the views were human.\n\nAnd there's a deeper engineering reason: thousands of views a second all trying to update ONE number in a database creates a traffic jam. So big apps split the counter into pieces on different servers and add them up every few seconds. That's why likes and views don't update instantly: eventual consistency.\n\nHow do they catch fake views? Comment VIEWS and I'll DM you the full breakdown 📩\n\n#systemdesign #youtube #backend #techinhindi #codinginhindi", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792465337, "like_count": 27, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18141783085575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 62.439, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMfF-Rxy3UvNmprZGYrfJdsn-Gz7L825vOlBysKo0R-ykTuatpanB6nOS3iao97w_Zdh93bbSdAiK1ryfQN2fqXlb2DWVA_vGt-LNc.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Adqk754uBxs5KjCCiZseCQHJeRgZUhQY4ZC31nL7KtOTUQqyqGO-fvhx0knB0uFFxM467IfEdb95Bk_IUr3OMoL2&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=lDqQNojxNj8Q7kNvwF4qcXX&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=YOC9MXtWrite1mrDxhsKhQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTltGAcHDhFLC8iFOzV-kTjFUORQxzfRT8Uduu2Y9N3Og&oe=6AF42F53", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 62.439, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko